commit 7be41c9a0d3f5e6b8c2a1d4f9e0b7c6a5d4e3f21
Author: Platform squad <platform@fernhill.example>
Date:   Tue Aug 18 16:52:10 2026 +0100

    perf(snapshots): skip the DELETE before the insert

    The nightly run only ever loads a new snapshot_date, so the DELETE finds
    nothing and costs a scan of the whole table (38 s of the task's 51 s).
    Removed it, and the explicit transaction that was only there for it.

    Reviewed-by: 1 approval. CI: lint, dag-integrity, tests green.

